ind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: Crows & Polish","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing and sending feedback! This update adds a bit more life to the valley. New Added crows. Flocks now appear in the valley during the day and can linger into the night Added dust particles for falling trees on impact Tweaks Improved the hint lights shown for tools like the pliers, wrench and crowbar Improved The Hollow's behavior If you run into anything else, let me know in the discussions or leave a bug report. It helps a lot, since I'm making this game solo. Stay close ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:20:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688960","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4805970-1846018067924687","game_id":"steam-4805970","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: Bug Fixes & Polish","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing and sending feedback! This update squashes a bunch of bugs that you found. Fixes Fixed getting stuck after standing up inside the tent when using hold-to-crouch Fixed the end screen and black screen overlapping and fighting each other Fixed the electrical box collision size Fixed a small flicker of light right before waking up after being caught Fixed The Hollow being seen moving at the very edge of your screen. If you can see it, it stays still Tweaks You now respawn ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T01:05:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4805970-1845383656391741","game_id":"steam-4805970","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: first-night freeze fixed","summary":"Hey everyone! Thanks to everyone 